<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: I knew you was comin’...\rThree years ago I had a vision of you\nshowin’ up. In that exact outfit.\rYou want my Chain.\rI don’t like scrappin’, but it’s my job\nto give Chains to anybody who prove\fthey\fworthy.\rSince you want it, I’ll show you my\nPSYCHIC powers!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: Your power... It’s WAY past\nwhat I foresaw...\rMaybe you can’t fully predict the\nfuture... That’s terrifyin’. I’m\fshook.\rAight, you win. You earned the Marsh\nChain.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Marsh Chain!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: I couldn’t predict your power\nright. That mean it’s beyond my\fpsychic\fability. That NEVER happen.\rYou deserve this. Take this TM too!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: It’s Trade Spots!\nIt swap Abilities between your\fhomie and theirs.\rYou gon’ be a famous and\nbeloved Kingpin!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina: Your love for your homies\nbroke through my psychic powers...\rThe ability to love, I think, is its\nown kinda psychic power...\fI should try it sometime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, future legend!\rA Hustler as nice as you don’t need to\nbe told how to handle Psychic homies,\fright?\rI expect BIG things from you! She\nalready know if you gon’ win.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That was ANOTHER crazy scrap! Sabrina\ndidn’t see it comin’. NOBODY did.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Saffron City Block\nTeleport Pads Not Refundable</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0531_T11GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Saffron City Block\rBoss: Sabrina\nGot Ran Through By:\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
